{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_title", "source_sha256": "60f68ec320ed4b1c0c6b76dabc3596773a12b07255c5e8a1bb534bada9d4b4f1", "ja": "煌めき、再び", "zh": "光芒，再次绽放", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5d8016c374167641fe292c26d39883c726e75d0df98c2560c1593378a1d1e4c8", "ja": "平民の少年ラファエルはある日突然「お前は\n貴族の子だ」と告げられ、士官学校に入れら\nれる。幼馴染のクララは彼を追い看護学校へ\n…オペラセリア・煌輝座のスピンオフ公演。\n新たな役に挑戦するアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "平民少年拉斐尔某天突然被告知“你是\n贵族的孩子”，并被送入了士官学校。\n青梅竹马的克拉拉为了追寻他而进入护士学校\n……这是Opera Seria·煌辉座的衍生公演。\n展现了偶像们挑战崭新角色的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1d65ed0a04d59bc08f8f5e240d6371dacb2736412b13ae358e5eb07712ef4199", "ja": "（オペラセリア・煌輝座の演劇公演\n『Parade d'amour』……）", "zh": "（歌剧塞利亚·煌辉座的戏剧公演《Parade d'amour》……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "934d55b2a5022dea77809adc0d0a6c1104e87e00a4e9764f36e4bd985c7db29f", "ja": "（今回、その新作スピンオフ公演が決まった。\n主演はエミリーと紬のふたりだ）", "zh": "（这次决定上演那部新作外传。主演是艾米莉和紬两人）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "edec2104ca49220d3e82f37e9320584ddf3c1271ca54b79191db617d110ba0cd", "ja": "ラファエルが……貴族の子……？\n私の大切な、幼馴染が……？", "zh": "拉斐尔……是贵族的孩子……？\n我最珍视的青梅竹马……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "97f959da9ee7a5072895b4c26fcf752ab39b01cde0e32b3313a996a25e2983d4", "ja": "（紬演じるラファエルは平民として暮らしていたが、\nある日突然、「お前は貴族の子だ」と告げられる）", "zh": "（由紬饰演的拉斐尔原本以平民身份生活，却在某天突然被告知：“你是贵族家的孩子。”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ddc228b6ccafa86c5b78def5b9866569aaa5c615a877874087207600febc4d9c", "ja": "（家督を継ぐため、無理矢理士官学校に入れられた\nラファエルは、幼馴染のクララと離れ離れになった）", "zh": "（为了继承家业，拉法埃尔被强行送进军官学校，也因此和青梅竹马的克拉拉分开了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b4cb5f09689d0e8b8eefa5bdd9322c07b28144d62de3329340c73175f42135ae", "ja": "（その後クララは、ラファエルの後を追うように、\n士官学校の隣にある看護学校へと進学する……）", "zh": "（之后，克拉拉仿佛追随着拉斐尔，升入了军官学校旁的护理学校……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "49b2f56f520433269782331a647890a71b555f96e7d46c0c772e9374218346a2", "ja": "なあ、マーカス、ラファエル。\n来週の交流会、楽しみだな！", "zh": "喂，马库斯、拉斐尔。\n真期待下周的交流会啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b2e12618b3251384a3e08d20b9e60ff20fede439eeb7dac3b4a17ef14170c928", "ja": "？　交流会……？", "zh": "咦？交流会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "b4c362514d7d2b44dc6f48bb652aacd3bb27d487e9601faff9baa389091d6e75", "ja": "ラファエルは初めてだったな。年に一度、\n士官学校と隣の看護学校とで、交流会があるんだ。", "zh": "拉斐尔还是第一次参加吧。每年都会有一次，军官学校和旁边的护理学校会举办交流会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "4393e6b77a696b6c7ae257c7716c130e1c84c2e94f1773e50e565c3612151496", "ja": "そうそう！　彼女達から、衛生や手当てについて\n習ったり。あとはバザーや、剣術大会も開かれるよ。", "zh": "对对！还会向她们学习卫生和急救之类的知识。另外，也会举办义卖会和剑术大会哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "53c1cca6aff9991663474505defe86c985bf6b7a281bf81adc59debe83af6d82", "ja": "ラファエルの幼馴染も、看護学校に通ってるって\n言ってたよな。久しぶりに会えるんじゃないか？", "zh": "你说过拉斐尔的青梅竹马也在上护理学校吧。这样就能和她久违地见面了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "7b474a2f3deb48485b17fd3871332e2e678851f4a07af35a2a55e0807a6b13d4", "ja": "交流会？　お隣と……？", "zh": "交流会？要和邻居……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1013_jyoseito", "source_sha256": "e21502b85f589a1648064e7509ff1617b9ba56eedeeed1d55c37c7a6c3b1419a", "ja": "ええ、来週なの。あ、でも\n中には乱暴な方もいるから、気を付けて……。", "zh": "是的，是下周。啊，不过有些人挺粗暴的，要小心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "f7cd6b89eb406a028162b2cd2e6ba1995d2d3c54fb6f16ee5bdcc8753ca98a52", "ja": "そう……。あの子に……\nラファエルに会えるのね……。", "zh": "是吗……。终于能见到那孩子……\n见到拉斐尔了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1015_student1", "source_sha256": "9af7d86eca550b90c0dc87d6c9186adb2f77ac4b68e2b3bc289690514a349305", "ja": "はぁ～～～。交流会とはいえ、まさかこの名誉ある\n士官学校の剣術大会で、平民が代表になるとはな～？", "zh": "唉～～～。虽说是交流会，没想到在这所享有盛誉的军官学校剑术大会上，平民居然会成为代表啊～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1016_student2", "source_sha256": "53ae40e059029c9f7fb06c73f4a0b26c14c0f2d5b55914f78e4403cc24d330d7", "ja": "彼は『元平民』ですよ。\n一応、貴族の子らしいですからね！", "zh": "他是『原平民』哦。\n毕竟好歹算是个贵族的孩子嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "c8333d6ef4579cebbe8de88b84d2d5e3bf6952372f8726074f11a5e41d3f0d78", "ja": "……？　なんだ、あいつら。感じ悪い……。\nラファエル、あんな奴らの言う事を気にするなよ。", "zh": "……？那些家伙怎么回事，真令人讨厌……\n拉斐尔，别把那些家伙的话放在心上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "bccdcc40999216e8a11e2363fb89a64931dd109f725cfeb600f29a28be93f803", "ja": "あいつは、剣術大会の代表を決める試合で\nラファエルに負けたから、妬んでいるんだろうな。", "zh": "那家伙在选拔剑术大会代表的比赛中输给了拉法埃尔，所以是在嫉妒吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "e0874e910d41887380a65c9f00cc776a30e84c16e2c9ea0a77b007a0653844cb", "ja": "大体、文句があるなら\n試合で勝てばいいだけなのに。", "zh": "说到底，要是有意见的话，\n只要在比赛里赢下来不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1021_null", "source_sha256": "517868da2caffad4f344a33954184e700e98abb9e9ddd3b3979d17bce324e986", "ja": "交流会当日……", "zh": "交流会当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1022_student2", "source_sha256": "714530ca1ceb5350e7084c2ff200a554314b18b6f4018aac85f133d4db62d6af", "ja": "ほら、お前！\nこっちに来て教えろって言ってるだろ！", "zh": "喂，你！我不是说让你过来告诉我吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "b84277e43dde05b76fc82f25a812e8e6019196dee1bd32350d8390aac87434fa", "ja": "！？　や、やめてください！\n放して……！", "zh": "！？呀、请住手！放开我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c49be0282de2c99cd52caf2b3ac1b36c89620423dc07d8dfb5fd8b7a7f1ee8bf", "ja": "クララ！？\n……お前達、女性に対して失礼だろう！", "zh": "克拉拉！？\n……你们这样对待女性，太失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1025_student1", "source_sha256": "b01ebb34f5d158980e8bb3e3213d4734fd4ab65f4ef09bb06bb9673b3a145e99", "ja": "なんだ、元平民か。\nああ……ということは、こいつも平民なんだな！", "zh": "什么嘛，原来以前是平民啊。\n啊……也就是说，这家伙也是平民啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1026_student2", "source_sha256": "ab5bca32de4e9e4e8267b3ae7ef8b2ee25da8d2d0cfb95b6ca96166e8b877e99", "ja": "平民のくせに看護学校に通ってるなんて、\nナマイキなんじゃないか？", "zh": "区区平民居然在上护士学校，\n未免也太嚣张了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "81cd24e2b3e9cf3df74f76cd500abf835f983b156b2f0cb2397be33a8a62e5fb", "ja": "やめろ！　クララは僕の大切な幼馴染だ。\nそれ以上侮辱したら、許さないぞ！", "zh": "住口！克拉拉是我最重要的青梅竹马。\n你要是再侮辱她，我绝不饶你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "8f9102b255ccf423ab83739a8bbb08d2f22a9ec2239829c99cd441c1d835069f", "ja": "ラファエル……！", "zh": "拉斐尔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cfeacb33296a5e46befe9fa62c544cceb6b6aaed27fd94e7af885435b52c0a65", "ja": "僕は何を言われてもいい。\nだが彼女や、友達をバカにするのはやめろ。", "zh": "不管你说我什么都无所谓。\n但是，别再嘲笑她和朋友了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "afd4f8bd06dca7880318f057723bb792af37e4ec2142b47ddb314cca45c87627", "ja": "……そういえば、剣術大会がどうとか言ってたっけ。\nなら、僕と模擬試合してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "……话说回来，你刚才好像提到了剑术大会什么的吧。\n那，要不要跟我来一场模拟战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cd0802fa53be2826690ca1fbbf30d4918a0b2e7aa908431455dae99d96b6b3b1", "ja": "君が勝ったら、代表を交代してあげるよ。\nそれとも、『元平民』に負けるのが怖いとでも？", "zh": "你要是赢了，我就把代表的位置让给你。\n还是说，你害怕输给“平民出身”的我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1032_student1", "source_sha256": "c3d8d4434f2c1a146403fd43211f171d1f221b67a1f547edd7c4f3002b25d80a", "ja": "こいつっ……！　いいだろう！\nその減らず口、二度と叩けなくしてやるっ！", "zh": "你这家伙……！好啊！\n我会让你再也没法逞口舌之快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "19577b737c79b67e990fa544dc1aa0fc53cc648528ccd64ecb197b322edb7093", "ja": "（勝敗は、あっという間についた。クララを侮辱した\n生徒に剣を突きつけながら、ラファエルは言った）", "zh": "（胜负转眼间就分出了结果。拉斐尔将剑指向侮辱克拉拉的学生，说道）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "03211376fc7e2193c23950056be73036178457facc5f91d5e7b534c8c9c52e14", "ja": "……僕の勝ちだ。今後一切、\n僕や彼女達の出自をバカにするのはやめろ。", "zh": "……是我赢了。今后休要再\n嘲弄我和她们的出身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "47d63a22c202899483511a0ebd5dd45a858dfd6ec7cc38d87cf40e43b06377d6", "ja": "ラファエル……。", "zh": "拉斐尔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1036_student1", "source_sha256": "4370ebd4fcbded5edca326c2142c9c9b2b4343a7dd14bf4dd852dd46cf595da4", "ja": "くそっ、言わせておけば……！", "zh": "可恶，竟敢这么说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "07ef8d5052db4ef8de2e2048459c81d0aeb68ad5975453ee7cbce0cd6d961a78", "ja": "お前達！　そこまでにしないか。\nお兄様の御前だぞ！", "zh": "你们！适可而止吧。\n这可是兄长大人在场啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1038_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2e4fa9710d6ce4b1a9713cf0ef39535fa5cb7f26aed551b755ec59b5aef5cdd0", "ja": "……！\nアリエル様、オスカー様……！", "zh": "……！\n阿里尔大人、奥斯卡大人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "41311183e6da6d50e950076f1a42aebfd360c82fd68e905820ef5b2133fef2bf", "ja": "ラファエルの言うとおりだよ。僕達が戦場で\nケガをしたら、手当てをしてくれるのは彼女達……。", "zh": "正如拉斐尔所说。我们要是在战场上受了伤，替我们治疗的就是她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "a04f5c38b818936da302c0d27d29e39463cf56bf499fefa4c9a461f2d4af731c", "ja": "天使達に嫌われて生き残れると、\n君は、本気で思うのかい？", "zh": "要是被天使们讨厌了还能活下来，\n你真觉得有这种可能吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "b427a77fbc26bba304f0ad480e58d1647659c50096e573242c8c9d00fe91373d", "ja": "それでもまだやるというなら、次は僕が相手だ。\nこの士官学校の生徒なら、僕の実力は知っているよな？", "zh": "即便如此，你还是要继续的话，接下来就由我来当你的对手。既然是这所军官学校的学生，你应该知道我的实力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1042_student1", "source_sha256": "0208e859ee18a226bbf68a6c3ab8ea37be944d2f988fdb7df6a4e200ee151173", "ja": "っ……！", "zh": "唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1043_student2", "source_sha256": "b0573b479370b40ac1dc6f0af91acebd7bd4e2673b7a802338cc6fd4c1a3e8be", "ja": "お、おい、行くぞ！", "zh": "你、你快点，要走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "1859dc3f73dc2b14d59758b7f8d305d26841923ba63653ca5168ecede0e8321e", "ja": "ラファエル、大丈夫！？\nああ、大変。頬に傷が……。", "zh": "拉斐尔，没事吧！？\n啊，糟糕。脸颊都受伤了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "58a23adabe98b6d4bcbf855fee6ba82e7c62713047217542e55a819413281e37", "ja": "こんなのケガのうちに入らない。君に叩き起こされて\nベッドから転げ落ちた時の方が、よっぽど痛かった。", "zh": "这种程度算不上受伤。被你拍醒、从床上滚下来时，反而更痛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "207f2746ac77aa342cb648215b12b13540bca345293f9a77e42517bcf3d1fd94", "ja": "ええ！？　……もう、ラファエルったら。\nふふ……。", "zh": "诶！？……真是的，拉斐尔。\n呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f1bad6d513dea83a4867bf2d11a3af4cd071ccf962913a2d85ca949acce54b50", "ja": "みんな、初日お疲れ様！　熱演だったな。\nお客さんの反応も良かったと思う！", "zh": "大家，首日辛苦了！演得真精彩。\n观众的反应也很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1048_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb87f9715e9f78f7d5ade4fae87564471b7e1f9dbc8f4c49b6ea1ec0f9dc1f59", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかった～！\n実はボク、けっこう緊張してたんですよね……。", "zh": "真的吗！？那太好了～！\n其实我还挺紧张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1049_006mak", "source_sha256": "decbb3c62fe77b68855db277e4ce357cdd3763910cdbf2d6598d75e4dd6d6e47", "ja": "カメラの前じゃなく、お客さんの前で\n生でお芝居するの、つい緊張しちゃって……へへ。", "zh": "不是在镜头前，而是在客人面前现场演戏，我一不小心就紧张了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "9c593f68e79ae1a78d75f57931ab3b10f1fa8717bf47b7c1b14b02fd47f2ec2d", "ja": "まぁ……真ちゃん、そうだったの？　全然、\nそうは見えなかったわ。すごく自然だったもの。", "zh": "哎呀……真，是这样吗？完全\n看不出来呢。表现得非常自然哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "a40f4a6957ea035236f6fefac09764a2418f9b6a53f9d8455b3f9d795775378f", "ja": "私も舞台は経験者だけど、歌織ちゃんと\nまつりちゃんは、オリジナルキャストですものね。", "zh": "我也有舞台经验，不过歌织和茉莉可是原班演员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "994a142a416973a4928092037b119faaeb0a412331b88e4a240d9810b3617dd0", "ja": "そうなのです！　久々にアリエルの台詞を言えて、\n姫はとっても楽しかったのですよ♪", "zh": "就是呀！隔了好久又能说出爱丽儿的台词，姬真的特别开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1053_p", "source_sha256": "c352a01b52a19e535a330353dee0276fff2c5bfb03181d4bcd49887dcc7d188d", "ja": "公演はまだ始まったばかりだ。\nみんな、千秋楽まで引き続きよろしくな！", "zh": "公演才刚刚开始。\n大家，接下来直到千秋乐也请继续多多关照啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
