{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_138_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_138_ng_01_1055_052kao", "source_sha256": "608ffb70a0e42c8dee41b689cf894fc921047eca0ee6b0c3dbcbe89220fd4437", "ja": "ええ、そうね。新しい物語を、\nお客さん達に、届けないと。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。必须把全新的故事传达给各位客人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
